---
description: Vitest fixtures and the default verify command
globs:
  - src/**/*.test.ts
  - vitest.config.ts
  - src/test/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Tests are `src/**/*.test.ts` (node environment, Phaser stubbed via `src/test/phaserStub.ts`).
- Don't assert against shipped `public/data/*.json` values; use inline fixtures.
- Default check is `npm run verify`. Don't start Playwright for a unit-test change.
- Colocate tests next to the module (`Foo.ts` + `Foo.test.ts`).
